1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,833
I defended the wrong person.

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,633
And you even complained right to my face.

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,366
I was the only one kept in the dark.

4
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:08,433
I worried Thanat would give you trouble.
You listened the whole time—was it funny?

5
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:12,100
No, I had the butler hide it. I was a jerk.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,600
I was terrified you'd be mistreated,
desperately covering for you. How could you?

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,600
I thought you liked Ah Tan.
Loving you made me too afraid to confess.

8
00:00:20,533 --> 00:00:23,666
You had so many chances.
Every time, you just swallowed your words.

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,966
You didn't reply at all.
I thought you took the punishment for me.

10
00:00:27,866 --> 00:00:32,333
The injured coworker is hospitalized.
Company is on it. I'm fine. No punishment.

11
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,733
The security isn't meant to trap you.
If you want to leave, I'll see you out.

12
00:00:40,166 --> 00:00:41,400
How hard was it to tell me you were safe?

13
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,833
Didn't you know I'd be scared?

14
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:47,800
My phone was muted during the meeting.
Making you wait was my fault. I'm sorry.

15
00:00:48,266 --> 00:00:49,166
It's true that I liked Ah Tan.

16
00:00:50,333 --> 00:00:51,866
But what do I even mean to you?

17
00:00:52,733 --> 00:00:53,333
I love you.

18
00:00:54,533 --> 00:00:55,500
I was wrong. Don't go.

19
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,266
But right now,
I can't believe a single word you say.

20
00:00:59,766 --> 00:01:02,466
I'm leaving this time.
I don't need your permission.

21
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:03,600
Nawin.

22
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,033
I won't let you leave.

23
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:06,833
No.

24
00:01:09,266 --> 00:01:12,033
You grab me right after apologizing.
Did you even hear a word I said?

25
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,000
If you walk away now,
you'll never want me again.

26
00:01:15,566 --> 00:01:18,600
So you won't even let me say
I don't want you.

27
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:33,200
Thanat.

28
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,100
Security is meant to keep outsiders out,
not trap him.

29
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:40,300
Take him to the annex. Give his phone
and ID to the butler. Don't let him leave.
